# Portfolio Template Source of Truth

Before generating any portfolio design-system output, read exactly one selected source file:

- Default source file: `portfolio-template-enterprise-b2b.md`
- Alternative source file: `portfolio-template-creative-studio.md`

Rules:
1. Always read the selected source file first.
2. Keep the same ASCII template structure in outputs.
3. Write all output in English only.
4. Adapt content to user request but preserve the style logic from source.
5. If user says "creative", switch source to `portfolio-template-creative-studio.md`.
6. If user says "enterprise" or "B2B", use `portfolio-template-enterprise-b2b.md`.